OL,5,G2200 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,6,     FD-Day, the 6th of June - one of
OL,7,     Fhistory's most pivotal moments. In
OL,8,     Fa massive armada of thousands of
OL,9,     Fships, three million Allied troops
OL,10,     Fland at Three Beaches in Normandy.
OL,11,G2230 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,12,     FSix weeks after the D-Day invasion
OL,13,     Fof the Beaches of Normandy, the
OL,14,     FAllied forces push the Germans
OL,15,     Fback through the hedgerows of the
OL,16,     FFrench countryside.
OL,17,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,18,     FCaroline is warned by the police
OL,19,     Fto expect the press to take an
OL,20,     Finterest in her. Sharon, angry
OL,21,     Fthat Kerry rejected her advances,
OL,22,     Fstirs up the women.
